        {
            "id": "https://skullbuns.com/a-spooky-walk-through-maple-park.html",
            "url": "https://skullbuns.com/a-spooky-walk-through-maple-park.html",
            "title": "A Spooky Walk Through Maple Park",
            "summary": "This game was originally made in only 3 days for the Cozy Fall Jam 2023 game jam. it is extremely&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<h2>Overview/Goal</h2>\n<p>This game was originally made in only 3 days for the <a href=\"https://itch.io/jam/cozy-fall-jam-2023\">Cozy Fall Jam 2023</a> game jam. it is extremely simple in terms of gameplay.</p>\n<h2>Media/Gallery</h2>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/3/gallery/Screenshot-2025-12-15-155702.png\" data-size=\"1145x646\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/3/gallery/Screenshot-2025-12-15-155702-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"433\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/3/gallery/Screenshot-2025-12-15-155717.png\" data-size=\"1143x644\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/3/gallery/Screenshot-2025-12-15-155717-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"433\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/3/gallery/pausemenu.png\" data-size=\"1152x644\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/3/gallery/pausemenu-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"429\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<h2>Contribution</h2>\n<h3>Tools used</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Godot Engine\n<ul>\n<li>GDScript (Scripting)</li>\n<li>Godot Shader Language (GLSL-like shader programming)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Trello (Task Management)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>My Role</h3>\n<p>I was the main designer and programmer on the game. I worked in a trio on this project, interacting with our musician to make a game with an adapative soundtrack and our playtester to improve iteratively on the games mechanics, UI and aethstetics.</p>\n<h3></h3>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>Reflection</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>",
            "image": "https://skullbuns.com/media/posts/3/fyXV45-2.png",
